4","id":718027043,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxODAyNzA0Mw==","user":{"login":"katre","id":326527,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjUyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/326527?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre","html_url":"https://github.com/katre","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/katre/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-28T15:51:07Z","updated_at":"2020-10-28T15:51:07Z","body":"Looks like `target_compatible_with` is declared differently than `exec_compatible_with`:\r\n\r\n- `target_compatible_with` is declared in [`BaseRuleClasses.commonCoreAndStarlarkAttributes`](https://cs.opensource.google/bazel/bazel/+/master:src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/analysis/BaseRuleClasses.java;drc=22b4dbcaf05756d506de346728db3846da56b775;l=339), which means it is picked up by all rules, native, starlark, and repository\r\n- `exec_compatible_with` is declared twice separately:\r\n   - [`BaseRuleClasses.RuleBase`](https://cs.opensource.google/bazel/bazel/+/master:src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/analysis/BaseRuleClasses.java;drc=3ce5531d9c1b1431b6e44ae6dfffd946e842cb28;l=451), which is the ancestor of all native non-repository rules\r\n   - [`StarlarkRuleClassFunctions.baseRule`](https://cs.opensource.google/bazel/bazel/+/master:src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/analysis/starlark/StarlarkRuleClassFunc